flowchart TD
    A["<code>pbvm create</code> / <code>pbvm search</code>"] --> B{"<code>-m</code> specified?"}
    B -->|Yes| C["Load specified mirror file"]
    B -->|No| D{"Current directory has<br/><code>.browsermr</code>?"}
    D -->|Yes| E["Load project-level .browsermr"]
    D -->|No| F{"Global config directory has<br/><code>.browsermr</code>?"}
    F -->|Yes| G["Load global .browsermr"]
    F -->|No| H["Use default download URL<br/>(@puppeteer/browsers)"]

    C --> I["Parse JSON, extract browser config"]
    E --> I
    G --> I

    I --> J["Get mirror URL template"]
    I --> K["Get platform mapping fields<br/>(platform / suffix / ext …)"]

    K --> L["Look up mapping values for current platform"]
    L --> M["Replace mapping variables<br/>(&lt;platform&gt; &lt;suffix&gt; &lt;ext&gt; …)"]
    J --> N["Replace fixed variables<br/>(&lt;browser&gt; &lt;buildId&gt; …)"]
    N --> M

    M --> O{"<code>--rule</code> specified?"}
    O -->|Yes| P["Override matching variables with --rule values"]
    O -->|No| Q["Assemble final download URL"]
    P --> Q
    Q --> R["Initiate HTTP download"]